packages, and audited 212 packages in 6s\n\n48 packages are looking for funding\n  run `npm fund` for details\n\n5 moderate severity vulnerabilities\n\nTo address all issues (including breaking changes), run:\n  npm audit fix --force\n\nRun `npm audit` for details.\nnpm warn install-scripts 2 packages have install scripts not yet covered by allowScripts:\nnpm warn install-scripts   esbuild@0.28.2 (postinstall: node install.js)\nnpm warn install-scripts   fsevents@2.3.3 (install: (install scripts present))\nnpm warn install-scripts\nnpm warn install-scripts Run `npm install-scripts ls` to review, or `npm install-scripts approve <pkg>` to allow.\n✔ npm add -D prisma@latest\n▸ npm add -D @prisma/cli-engine@0.9.0\n\nup to date, audited 212 packages in 1s\n\n48 packages are looking for funding\n  run `npm fund` for details\n\n5 moderate severity vulnerabilities\n\nTo address all issues (including breaking changes), run:\n  npm audit fix --force\n\nRun `npm audit` for details.\nnpm warn install-scripts 2 packages have install scripts not yet covered by allowScripts:\nnpm warn install-scripts   esbuild@0.28.2 (postinstall: node install.js)\nnpm warn install-scripts   fsevents@2.3.3 (install: (install scripts present))\nnpm warn install-scripts\nnpm warn install-scripts Run `npm install-scripts ls` to review, or `npm install-scripts approve <pkg>` to allow.\n✔ npm add -D @prisma/cli-engine@0.9.0\n▸ Emit the contract\n✔ Emit the contract\n│  target:     postgres\n│  authoring:  psl\n│  schema:     src/prisma/contract.prisma\n\nwritten\n├─ src/prisma/contract.prisma\n├─ prisma.config.ts\n├─ src/prisma/db.ts\n├─ prisma-8.md\n├─ .env.example\n├─ tsconfig.json\n├─ .gitignore\n├─ .gitattributes\n└─ package.json\ninstalled\n├─ @prisma/orm-postgres\n├─ dotenv\n├─ prisma@latest (dev)\n└─ @prisma/cli-engine@0.9.0 (dev)\n\n✔ Done. Open prisma-8.md to get started.\n→ Set DATABASE_URL in your environment (export it or add it to .env)\n→ Edit your schema at src/prisma/contract.prisma, then emit again\n→ Open prisma-8.md for a quick reference on writing your first typed query\n→ Set up the Prisma agent skills for your coding agent: prisma init\nsrc/prisma/contract.prisma\nprisma.config.ts\nsrc/prisma/db.ts\nprisma-8.md\n.env.example\ntsconfig.json\n.gitignore\n.gitattributes\npackage.json\nPrisma agent skills are out of date (installed @prisma/orm-postgres 8.0.0-rc.23, synced none). Run: prisma skills sync\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
